<title>POLAND: BUDIMEX WINS $8 MLN CONTRACT.</title>
<headline>BUDIMEX WINS $8 MLN CONTRACT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish construction company Budimex SA said in a Thursday statement it had won an $8 million contract from the Norwegian firm Interscandia to build an office building in Warsaw.</p>
<p>It said the work of the builing, called &quot;Norway House&quot; would be completed in December 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
